{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "latam", "appid": 553850, "month": "2026-03", "window": 4, "start_date": 1774310400, "end_date": 1775001599, "month_true_total": 168, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:21:56 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "222208044", "author": {"steamid": "76561198412173669", "personaname": "Muninn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Metalheadcrow/", "num_games_owned": 203, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 5752, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 155, "playtime_at_review": 605, "last_played": 1787534696, "avatar": "a2816b3757a444eb3ef6812e1795b6b2c95c24c8"}, "language": "latam", "review": "10/10", "timestamp_created": 1774991716, "timestamp_updated": 1774991716, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222207761", "author": {"steamid": "76561199848187751", "personaname": "indorcito", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199848187751/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 12588, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1867, "playtime_at_review": 1954, "last_played": 1788066159, "avatar": "013a95fd96f9b55c51e511c9a779cfe0e718e139"}, "language": "latam", "review": "juego absolutamente supremo 20/10 y hay que impartir la democracia", "timestamp_created": 1774991406, "timestamp_updated": 1774991406, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222189777", "author": {"steamid": "76561198828149991", "personaname": "FelipeHD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198828149991/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5732, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 243, "playtime_at_review": 3567, "last_played": 1787585014, "avatar": "fab32d5d7261d73e15dc105bc704823f92b15c38"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Maldito juegazo todo god, lo amo. Larga vida a la supertierra y la humanidad!", "timestamp_created": 1774975649, "timestamp_updated": 1774975705, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222152927", "author": {"steamid": "76561199063279590", "personaname": "samurai", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/saijaku/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 9551, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3367, "playtime_at_review": 723, "last_played": 1788058060, "avatar": "397c42dccfbd071dc5aea56d487d147d18bcf1da"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Hay juegos que intentan ser épicos… y después está Helldivers 2, que logra serlo a base de caos, explosiones y errores humanos absolutamente evitables.\r\n\r\nDesde el primer minuto, el juego deja claro su tono: sos un soldado descartable en una guerra interplanetaria donde la “democracia” se impone a punta de bombardeos orbitales. La narrativa es una sátira constante, pero nunca interrumpe lo importante: el gameplay.\r\n\r\nY ahí es donde brilla.\r\n\r\nEl combate es intenso, rápido y sorprendentemente táctico. No alcanza con disparar: tenés que coordinarte, posicionarte bien y, sobre todo, no matar a tus compañeros… aunque eso pasa más seguido de lo que debería. El fuego amigo no es un detalle menor, es parte del ADN del juego, y convierte cada misión en una mezcla perfecta de estrategia y desastre.\r\n\r\nUno de los mayores aciertos son las estratagemas: ataques, suministros y herramientas que pedís en medio del combate ingresando combinaciones de botones bajo presión. Esto genera momentos únicos, donde un simple error puede significar la diferencia entre salvar al equipo o aniquilarlo.\r\n\r\nPero Helldivers 2 no es para todos.\r\n\r\nSi jugás solo, la experiencia pierde muchísimo. El juego está diseñado para el cooperativo, para reírte, frustrarte y coordinar con otros. Sin eso, puede volverse repetitivo rápidamente. Además, aunque ha mejorado, todavía arrastra algunos problemas técnicos que pueden romper el ritmo.\r\n\r\nAun así, cuando todo funciona —cuando el equipo está sincronizado, las bombas caen en el momento justo y logran escapar con vida—, pocos juegos logran generar esa sensación de misión cumplida.", "timestamp_created": 1774932110, "timestamp_updated": 1774932110, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222151213", "author": {"steamid": "76561199465882992", "personaname": "Mr.Logan", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199465882992/", "num_games_owned": 49, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 40458, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 490, "playtime_at_review": 36568, "last_played": 1787795133, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "latam", "review": "400 horas más y tendré una opinión 100% correcta sobre este juego", "timestamp_created": 1774929661, "timestamp_updated": 1774929661, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222119487", "author": {"steamid": "76561198388050798", "personaname": "iG0d", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/iG0dMeXi/", "num_games_owned": 41, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3548, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3548, "last_played": 1770792146, "avatar": "5b28334a8d519bb3298c5717baaa9430b6206413"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Viva la democracia!!", "timestamp_created": 1774893745, "timestamp_updated": 1774893745, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}